+/**
+ *  @brief This function prepares command of rf_channel.
+ *
+ *  @param pmpriv       A pointer to mlan_private structure
+ *  @param cmd          A pointer to HostCmd_DS_COMMAND structure
+ *  @param cmd_action   The action: GET or SET
