+/**
+ *  @brief This function handles the command response error
+ *
+ *  @param pmpriv       A pointer to mlan_private structure
+ *  @param resp         A pointer to HostCmd_DS_COMMAND
+ *  @param pioctl_buf   A pointer to command buffer
+ *
+ *  @return             N/A
