+ *  @brief Set/Get WAPI status
+ *
+ *  @param pmadapter	A pointer to mlan_adapter structure
+ *  @param pioctl_req	A pointer to ioctl request buffer
+ *
+ *  @return		MLAN_STATUS_SUCCESS --success
