+ *  @brief Get debug info
+ *
+ *  @param priv                 A pointer to moal_private structure
+ *  @param wait_option          Wait option
+ *  @param debug_info           A pointer to mlan_debug_info structure
+ *
+ *  @return                     MLAN_STATUS_SUCCESS/MLAN_STATUS_PENDING --
